@title Start screen with recent project cards
@area Start
# Visual redesign section 10: tiles, recent project cards with a first-page picture, capability cards.
open crates/novo-tests/tests/golden/v0.1-motor-starter.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text close project
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
shot cards
check_blank cards
check_layout
expect "Recent projects"
expect "What else is in here"
expect "Open example"
expect "Commissioning"
# A capability card starts its lesson.
click_text Heat
wait 40
shot heat-card-lesson
expect "Heat"
